a-reader-mac/Entitlements.plist:L5-L6.
libgit2-sys | getenv | Library initialisation reads the process environment to seed search-path guesses. The sandbox selects the password entry for the global and home guesses; the XDG guess still reads the XDG and home values. Before any repository handle exists, the bridge empties the four machine search levels. The remaining home guess can expand a home-relative value, but the reader stops such a value as not located before opening it. These initialisation reads therefore change no file the shipped process opens. The ownership read runs only with effective root identity, outside the shipped app's execution. Other occurrences are declarations, dormant calls, uncompiled code or build text; they do not read the shipped process's environment.

